    "image_with_text_KHFnQn": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<h2><strong>Inspired by the Earth’s Beating Heart</strong></h2><p>The Amazon rainforest — a vital force for our planet — inspired every detail of this collection. Each tone, texture, and finish pays tribute to the vibrant life it shelters: the iridescent feathers of exotic birds, the vivid petals of tropical flowers, the lush green of dense vegetation, and the rich, grounding hues of the forest floor.</p><p>This palette captures the Amazon’s rhythm — a harmony of colours and sensations that breathe life into interiors, infusing them with the energy and authenticity of nature’s most diverse ecosystem.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "shopify://products/electra-collection-copy",
