    "image_with_text_hLhpG3": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<h2><strong>A Celebration of Beauty and Responsibility</strong></h2><p></p><p>The Amazónia collection is more than a range of coated fabrics — <strong>it is a creative homage to one of the world’s most extraordinary natural treasures.</strong> Inspired by the Amazon rainforest, its designs serve as a gentle reminder of the beauty and richness that nature offers and the importance of preserving it.</p><p>Each metre of fabric carries an invitation — to imagine, to be inspired, and to create spaces that celebrate both exceptional design and the wonders that shape our planet.</p><p><strong>Celebrate design. Honour what inspires.</strong></p>",
        "button_label": "Download Catalogue",
        "button_link": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0711/9801/5791/files/AMAZONIA_Catalogue.pdf?v=1779958797",
        "text_alignment": "left",
